HB0266 Food truck licensing-statewide application.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larson, JT, Andrew, Williams and
Wylie and Senator(s) Barlow, Nethercott and Salazar
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; authorizing food trucks to operate
throughout the state as specified; making conforming amendments; requiring
rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
